How to Book a Verified Technician on Mekh: A Beginner's Guide
Mekh is Kenya's premier automotive services marketplace that connects car owners with verified professional technicians. Whether you need window tinting, car wrapping, ceramic coating, or mechanical repairs, Mekh makes it easy to find and book trusted specialists in your area. This guide walks you through the entire process of booking a verified technician, from searching to completing your service.

Step 1: Create Your Client Account
Before you can book a technician, you'll need to create a free client account on Mekh:

Visit mekh.app
Click "Sign In" 
Choose to sign up with email/password or Google OAuth
Complete your profile with your name and phone number
Verify your email if required
Having an account allows you to:

Save your booking history
Leave reviews after services
Get notifications about your bookings
Access exclusive client features
Step 2: Search for Technicians
Mekh offers multiple ways to find the right technician for your needs:

Smart Search Options
By Service Type:

Search specific services like "window tinting", "car wrapping", or "ceramic coating"
Use service variants like "3M tint" or "full vehicle wrap"
Browse by categories: Body & Exterior, Electricals, Mechanical, Interior
By Location:

Enable location permissions to find technicians near you
Search by area (e.g., "Karen", "Westlands", "Kilimani")
Filter for mobile technicians who come to your location
View technicians within specific counties
By Reputation:

Browse top-rated technicians (highest average ratings)
Filter for technicians with mobile service capabilities
Look for technicians with verified profiles (admin-approved)
Search Results Display
Each technician card shows:

Business name and profile photo
Average rating (★) and number of reviews
Experience years and service type
Mobile service availability (mobile/studio/both)
Primary service area and county
Sample pricing for their main services
Step 3: Review Technician Profiles
Once you find promising technicians, click on their profile to learn more. Here's what information is available on each technician's profile:

Basic Information
Business Name & Avatar: Professional branding with profile photo
Experience: Years of experience in the industry
Service Type: Mobile service (comes to you), studio-based, or both
Location: Specific area and county they serve
Rating Summary: Average rating out of 5 stars and total review count
Portfolio & Media
Portfolio Photos: Grid of work samples showcasing their craftsmanship
Videos: TikTok videos demonstrating techniques
About Section: Personal bio describing their expertise and approach
Services & Pricing
Service List: Comprehensive list of all offered services
Pricing Structure: Base prices for each service (in Kenyan shillings)
Service Variants: Specific options like "3M Tint" vs "Local Tint" with different price points
Negotiable Services: Marked as "Negotiable" if prices can be discussed
Service Notes: Additional details about what's included or special considerations
Additional Details
Business Hours: Operating hours including availability on request
Location Map: Interactive map showing their service area or exact location
Reviews Section
Review List: All approved client reviews with ratings and comments
Would Rebook: Percentage of clients who would book again
Review Timeline: Recent reviews shown first
Step 4: Book Your Service
When you find the right technician:

Initiate Booking
Click "Book Now" on the technician's profile or service card
If you're not logged in, you'll be redirected to sign in first
The booking modal will open with pre-filled information
Fill Booking Details
Required Information:

Your Name: Pre-filled from your account
Service Selection: Choose from the technician's available services
Service Variants: Select specific options if available (e.g., tint type, wrap size)
Optional Details:

Additional Details: Describe specific requirements (e.g., "dark tint for all windows", "need service this weekend")
Vehicle Model: Your car make and model (e.g., "Toyota Noah", "BMW X5")
Your Location: Enter your area or use location detection for mobile services
Booking Process
Click "Connect on WhatsApp" to submit your booking
The system automatically creates a lead record
A pre-filled WhatsApp message opens with your booking details
The technician receives notification of your inquiry
Your phone number is shared only with this specific technician
WhatsApp Integration
The WhatsApp message includes:

Your name and location
Selected service and variants
Vehicle model (if provided)
Additional details
Clear call-to-action for the technician to respond
Step 5: Complete the Service & Leave a Review
Service Completion
Communicate directly with the technician via WhatsApp
Coordinate timing, pricing, and service details
Complete the service at agreed location and time
Receive invoice and make payment as arranged
Post-Service Review
After your service is marked as completed:

Return to the technician's profile
Click "Write a Review" (only available for completed bookings)
Rate the service (1-5 stars)
Leave an honest review describing your experience
Indicate if you would book with them again
Submit the review
Review Approval Process
Approved reviews appear on the technician's profile
Help other clients make informed decisions
Contribute to the technician's reputation score
Tips for a Successful Booking
Before Booking
Compare Multiple Technicians: Check 2-3 profiles to compare pricing and reviews
Verify Location: Ensure mobile technicians serve your area
Check Availability: Review business hours for scheduling
Read Recent Reviews: Focus on reviews from the past 6 months
During Booking
Be Specific: Include details about your vehicle and service requirements
Ask Questions: Use WhatsApp to clarify pricing or service details
Confirm Timing: Agree on dates, times, and duration upfront
After Service
Leave Honest Feedback: Your review helps maintain platform quality
Save Contact: Keep the technician's WhatsApp for future services
Share Experience: Help other clients by providing detailed reviews
Mekh's Verification System
Mekh ensures quality through a multi-layer verification process:

Technician Verification Levels
Pending: New applications awaiting admin review
Live: Fully verified and approved to take bookings
Suspended: Temporarily inactive (rare)
Quality Assurance
Profile Review: Admin approval required before going live
Review Moderation: All client reviews must be approved
Lead Tracking: All bookings are recorded and monitored
Service Confirmation: Admin oversight of completed jobs
Trust Indicators
Verified Badge: Shows admin-approved status
Review Count: Higher review numbers indicate reliability
Rating Consistency: Look for consistent high ratings
Response Time: Check how quickly technicians respond to inquiries

Pricing Considerations
Factors Affecting Price
Vehicle Size: Larger vehicles cost more for services like tinting or wrapping
Service Complexity: Premium options (3M tint vs local) have higher costs
Material Quality: Higher quality materials increase pricing
Location: Mobile service may include travel fees
Negotiability: Some technicians mark services as negotiable
Average Price Ranges (2026)
Window Tinting: KSh 8,000 - 25,000
Car Wrapping: KSh 15,000 - 80,000+
Ceramic Coating: KSh 12,000 - 35,000
Car Detailing: KSh 3,000 - 15,000
Headlight Restoration: KSh 2,000 - 8,000
Mechanical Services: KSh 1,000 - 10,000+
Conclusion
Booking a verified technician on Mekh is straightforward and secure. The platform's verification system, comprehensive profiles, and WhatsApp integration make it easy to find reliable professionals. By following this guide, you can confidently book automotive services while ensuring quality workmanship and fair pricing.

Remember to always review technician profiles thoroughly, compare options, and leave honest reviews to help maintain the platform's quality standards. Mekh continues to grow as Kenya's trusted automotive marketplace, connecting car owners with professional technicians across Nairobi and beyond.

